{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/023-ski-racer-table/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"62164557-2e27-5f7c-9b53-ebc59edad783","excerpt":"The recliners needed some companions - somewhere to set a drink while relaxing. But I wanted something more interesting than a typical side table. The design…","html":"<p>The recliners needed some companions - somewhere to set a drink while relaxing. But I wanted something more interesting than a typical side table. The design that emerged was inspired by a downhill ski racer in a tuck position.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/a878e/leg_joinery.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Leg Joinery\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/f058b/leg_joinery.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/c26ae/leg_joinery.png 158w,\n/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/6bdcf/leg_joinery.png 315w,\n/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/f058b/leg_joinery.png 630w,\n/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/40601/leg_joinery.png 945w,\n/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/78612/leg_joinery.png 1260w,\n/static/8e58ed3a497df602a4e845f5cdb10cea/a878e/leg_joinery.png 2048w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The legs were cut from thick curly maple, with mortise and tenon joinery connecting the angled pieces. Getting the angles right while maintaining structural integrity took careful planning and special jigs for clamping and glue ups.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/71c1d/profile.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Profile\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/f058b/profile.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/c26ae/profile.png 158w,\n/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/6bdcf/profile.png 315w,\n/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/f058b/profile.png 630w,\n/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/40601/profile.png 945w,\n/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/78612/profile.png 1260w,\n/static/896c917fa47a28b8eeeb5dd5d201ede6/71c1d/profile.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The finished profile shows the distinctive Z-shape that gives the table its name. From the side, you can almost see the ski racer crouching for speed. The curves were refined with sandpaper until they felt right.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/a878e/curly_top.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Curly Top\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/f058b/curly_top.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/c26ae/curly_top.png 158w,\n/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/6bdcf/curly_top.png 315w,\n/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/f058b/curly_top.png 630w,\n/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/40601/curly_top.png 945w,\n/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/78612/curly_top.png 1260w,\n/static/9b59422a77a60dcee5f58c194cae52db/a878e/curly_top.png 2048w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Coasters cut from curly maple matched the legs while providing contrast with the top.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/71c1d/in_use.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"In Use\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/f058b/in_use.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/c26ae/in_use.png 158w,\n/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/6bdcf/in_use.png 315w,\n/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/f058b/in_use.png 630w,\n/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/40601/in_use.png 945w,\n/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/78612/in_use.png 1260w,\n/static/a8ba2ff2043fccc9ed13f80dc1f4e867/71c1d/in_use.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The egg shaped top was made from bookmatched walnut. A thick, substantial top balanced the dynamic leg design.</p>\n<p>In its spot beside the recliner, the table does exactly what it should - holds a cold drink at the perfect height. The sculptural design sparks conversation, and the curly maple catches afternoon light beautifully.</p>\n<p>Furniture doesn’t have to be boring. A simple side table became an opportunity to explore form and function, to make something that serves its purpose while also being a small work of art.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Ski Racer Table","date":"August 17, 2019","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/021-mantle/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Mantle"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/024-wood-cookie-table/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Wood Cookie Table"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"62164557-2e27-5f7c-9b53-ebc59edad783","previousPostId":"4de2cc84-af9d-593c-a193-b45a9cae93f0","nextPostId":"27e0765e-6657-5ca4-913c-71be8ef0e6b4"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}